    "catalogue_description": "This is a map originally in CS 1.6 created by Squall. (Squall\u2019s website: https://redsquall.net/csmaps.php ) This is a small map with a very challenging layout that will test even the best of zombie players to their limits. With it\u2019s unforgiving layout, it can punish you for any mistakes you make. It is you against the zombies with no bs in-between. This map features: \u2013 harrybo21 perks which add doubletap 2.0 and other perks from Black Ops 3. \u2013 Unlimited perks. \u2013 1:1 scale of the CS 1.6 map with similar if not the same textures used. \u2013 Double Pack a Punch-able weapons. \u2013 An all-round fun experience! If there are any problems or glitches please let me know as this is my first zombies map and it hasn\u2019t really been tested on anyone else\u2019s pc.",
